# reactormc.net vendor copies

The public site vendors this engine for:

- `/belvoirdynamics/visualizer` ← `src/preview/` (not `webview.ts`, not `openmcNative/`)
- `/belvoirdynamics/converter` ← `src/converter/` (not `command.ts`, `rosettaView.ts`, `adapterCommand.ts`) plus `src/compare/canonical.ts`

**Do not leave the site on an old copy.** After you change any of those files,
from `C:\Users\calho\GitHub\reactor-monte-carlo-guide` run:

```
npm run sync:owen-vendor
npm run verify:owen-vendor
npm run typecheck
npm run verify:mcnp-geometry
```

The site script rewrites `../preview` → `../owen-preview` (and compare/converter
the same way). It will not overwrite the site-only files listed in
`reactor-monte-carlo-guide/.cursor/rules/owen-vendor.mdc`.

If this session cannot reach the site repo, say so in the reply and name
`npm run sync:owen-vendor` as the leftover — do not silently skip it.
